From 848ccc92e6940c3bd683790e882ce75965cdd44e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: warelik <warelik@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:25:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] Add project_panel.sticky_root_tab_height setting

The topmost sticky directory is a regular list row, shorter than the
tab bar next to it. With this setting it takes the tab bar height and
the sticky rows below it shift down accordingly.
---
 assets/settings/default.json                  |  2 +
 crates/project_panel/src/project_panel.rs     | 14 ++++
 .../src/project_panel_settings.rs             |  2 +
 crates/settings/src/vscode_import.rs          |  1 +
 crates/settings_content/src/workspace.rs      |  4 ++
 crates/ui/src/components/sticky_items.rs      | 64 +++++++++++++------
 6 files changed, 69 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

